    "en": "Many “signs” shared today come from weak or unknown reports, or force a narration onto a current event or a living person. The Imams named the signs to strengthen hope, not to fix a date or crown a leader. The Imam's own last letter warns that anyone who claims to have seen him before the Sufyani and the Cry is lying.",
